{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Rainbow Shell is found via ",["l","采集","foraging"]," at ",["l","沙滩","The Beach"]," in the Summer. It may also spawn on the ",["l","农场地图","Beach Farm"]," during any season or in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," after activating the ",["l","矿井","Shrine of Challenge"]," or during the ",["l","任务","Danger In The Deep"]," quest. It may also be sent in the mail as a gift from ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]," or received as a gift from ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]," or ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]," at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". A ",["l","虹鳟鱼","Rainbow Trout"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," has a 2% chance to produce 1 Rainbow Shell daily when the population of the pond reaches 9. It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," turtle with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],". It may also randomly appear at the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 900–1,500g."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","哈维","Harvey"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Rainbow Shell is not used in any ",["l","收集包","Bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Rainbow Shell is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Rainbow Shell is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the dyeable ",["f","Shirt134.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Bikini Top"],"."]],["p",["Using a Rainbow Shell with the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to ",["l","染色","dye"]," clothing will open a menu where any color can be chosen using slider buttons."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["1 Rainbow Shell is used in ",["l","任务","The Mysterious Qi"]," quest."]],[1,["1 Rainbow Shell may be requested by ",["l","水滴鱼","Blobfish"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 7 to 10."]]]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["An exploit to get the Rainbow Shell is to wait until Demetrius sends a gift in the mail, then reload the game until the shell is received."]]]]]]]}